# Kernel Specification — Top-K Q-Axis Fused Decode Attention

**Milestone:** M0 (specification only; no implementation)
**Date:** 2026-05-07
**Architecture target:** Ubuntu 22.04 WSL2, RTX 4060 Ti (16 GB, compute capability 8.9)
**Model reference:** meta-llama/Llama-3.2-1B (verified via AutoConfig 2026-05-07)
**transformers version pinned:** 5.6.2

This document is the written contract for what the kernel must do. All downstream
milestones (M1 Python reference, M2/M3 Triton kernel, M5 validation suite) are
checked against this spec by section number. Do not modify this file without
architect review.

