## §1. Inputs and Outputs

### §1.1 Model dimensions (Llama-3.2-1B, locked)

| Parameter | Value | Source |
|-----------|-------|--------|
| `num_hidden_layers` | 16 | AutoConfig |
| `num_attention_heads` (H) | 32 | AutoConfig |
| `num_key_value_heads` (H_kv) | 8 | AutoConfig — GQA factor of 4 |
| `head_dim` (D) | 64 | hidden_size(2048) / H(32) |
| `hidden_size` | 2048 | AutoConfig |
| `max_position_embeddings` | 131072 | AutoConfig |

GQA mapping: each KV head serves `H / H_kv = 4` query heads.
For query head `h`, the corresponding KV head is `h_kv = h // 4`.

### §1.2 Input tensors

| Tensor | Shape | Dtype | Layout | Notes |
|--------|-------|-------|--------|-------|
| `Q` | `[B, H, D]` | bf16 | row-major contiguous | Single decode token, post-RoPE |
| `K_cache` | `[B, H_kv, N, D]` | bf16 | row-major contiguous in N | DynamicCache layer extract |
| `V_cache` | `[B, H_kv, N, D]` | bf16 | row-major contiguous in N | DynamicCache layer extract |

### §1.3 Output tensor

| Tensor | Shape | Dtype | Layout |
|--------|-------|-------|--------|
| `O` | `[B, H, D]` | bf16 | row-major contiguous |

### §1.4 Scalar inputs

| Name | Type | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| `k_eff` | int | Effective top-K window size: `max(k_min, ceil(c_floor * N))` |
| `c_floor` | float ∈ (0,1] | Coverage floor (e.g., 0.5); used by caller to compute k_eff |
| `k_min` | int | Minimum window size, default 64 (equals T_dispatch in DCRLlamaConfig) |

### §1.5 Regime

- B: 1–8 (Track 3: B=4 stable, B=8 OOM in Python path; Triton kernel target: B=1–8)
- N: 64–20000 (validated range; architectural max 131072)
- k_eff: k_min to min(N, 10000) at c_floor=0.5, N=20K

